  "title": "VampireReborn",
  "description": "Dark fantasy modpack mainly based on Vampirism, assembled to be challenging and atmospheric.",
  "body": "# VampireReborn\n```Balancing stage```\n\n- Based on [Neon](https://modrinth.com/modpack/neon-modpack)\n<p align=\"left\">\n     <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/WasteLandOrigin/VampireReborn/wiki/gpg\">\n          <img src=\"https://gpg-badge.hesreallyhim.com/SpiritOTHawk?style=flat\" alt=\"GPG Key badge\" />\n              </a>\n</p>\n\n## About\nModpack that based on vampire thematic. In addition to the main play route, there is a technological and research path.\n\n### Main modpack features\nOur modpack has a mechanics of classes. There are main and additional, the main class can be one and it is determined by the player, and additional ones depend on the style of play.\n\n#### Four main classes\n- Vampire\n- Vampire Hunter\n- Werewolf\n- Human\n#### Many additional classes\n(*Based on style of play*)\n- Mechanic\n- Warrior/knight\n- Archer/musketeer\n- Hunter\n- Builder\n- Cook/Brewer\n- Archaeologist\n- Alchemist/Sorcerer\n\n#### Vampires\n![Vampire](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa2e72ed5e5a95631ad5cd1b69fbcda348865bce.webp)\n#### Hunters\n![Hunter](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff43c2a9351b9365ea6d8a08fda240166698508f.webp)\n#### Werewolves\n![Werewolf](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb6250eacd66defc46c6c4d2a1fd1679d6ed5ba4.webp)\n\n*This description is still under development.*\n\n## Wiki\n<a href=\"https://codeberg.org/WasteLandOrigin/VampireReborn/wiki\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/177c080a1756a9fd8989fb30df072e214a1677bb_0.webp\" alt=\"Do it!\" width=\"128\"></a>\n\n### Can we go through the entire modpack?\nThe modpack has no logical conclusion, but if you want to test yourself, there are several objectives:\n- Work in progress\n\n### Current dev stage: **Balancing**\n- You can report balance-related ideas on the codeberg issue tracker or on our Discord.\n\n### Performance\nWe recommend allocate minimum 8GB of ram for singleplayer game and 5GB for playing on server. And quad core cpu is strongly recommended.\n\n## Community\nWe are an open community, always ready to help. We have our own discord server with a forum, a codeberg page where you can leave noticed bugs or your suggestions.\n\n[![Discord Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=fff&style=for-the-badge)](https://discord.gg/UBaauaN)",
